### Necessário para pegar o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:43000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "UserName": "qwe",
    "Password": "qwe"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### teste de buscar todos os registros
GET http://localhost:43000/getAllAlocados HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar por ID
GET http://localhost:43000/getAlocadoByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar dados para o select
GET http://localhost:43000/getAnimaisToAlocados HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar dados para o select
GET http://localhost:43000/getPiquetesToAlocados HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de inserção
POST http://localhost:43000/insertAlocado HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "animalidifk": 3,
    "piqueteidfk": 4,
    "datainicio": "2026-11-01",
    "datafinal": null
}

### teste de atualização
PUT http://localhost:43000/updateAlocado/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "animalidifk": 1,
    "piqueteidfk": 1,
